-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §88 מינוי לתקופה קצובה ושיבוץ נוסף (part כ):
-- a principal chosen by tender from תשס"ח is appointed for ten years (an
-- existing one from his move to the reform); he is evaluated during them;
-- at the end he is placed as principal of another school without a tender,
-- exceptionally in his own; and the ordinary ways of ending his work
-- remain.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `88 מינוי לתקופה קצובה ושיבוץ נוסף`

-- (א)–(ב): ten years, from the appointment, or for an existing principal
-- from his move to the reform.
@ref akn:art_88__para_a akn:art_88__para_b
`years of a principal's term` MEANS 10

GIVEN `term starts` IS A NUMBER @desc the year the appointment, or the existing principal's move to the reform, falls in
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the term ends in` `term starts` IS
    `term starts` PLUS `years of a principal's term`

DECLARE `section 88 action` IS ONE OF
    `evaluate the principal`
    `place the principal as principal of another school`

-- (ג): an evaluation during the term, by a mechanism the Ministry sets with
-- the union's prior consultation.
@ref akn:art_88__para_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 88 action`
DECIDE `the principal's evaluation` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `evaluate the principal`
    WITHIN 3650
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "section 88(ג): the principal is evaluated during the term"

-- (ד): at the end, another school without a tender; exceptionally his own.
DECLARE `principal's next post` IS ONE OF `principal of another school`, `principal of the same school`

@ref akn:art_88__para_d
GIVEN `an exceptional case by the Ministry's criteria` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `principal's next post`
DECIDE `the post at the end of the term` `an exceptional case by the Ministry's criteria` IS
    IF `an exceptional case by the Ministry's criteria` THEN `principal of the same school` ELSE `principal of another school`

-- (ה): the existing rules on ending a principal's work are not affected.
@ref akn:art_88__para_e
`the existing rules on ending a principal's work remain` MEANS TRUE

#ASSERT `the term ends in` 2008 EQUALS 2018
#ASSERT `the post at the end of the term` FALSE EQUALS `principal of another school`
